Based on regression fitting, reduced-form expressions for each strength parameter are presented in Eqs. (4)-(6). The categorical Pattern variable is retained in the ANOVA framework but is not explicitly expressed in the reduced equations, as these equations are intended to represent the continuous-variable trend component within the tested matrix rather than the full categorical model structure. Accordingly, the reduced equations describe variable trends within the tested experimental domain and are not intended for prediction beyond the scope of the present dataset. 4 \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
